      "content": "Here are a few options, ranging from strictly factual to slightly empathetic, keeping a serious and professional tone.\n\n**Option 1 (Direct & Technical):** \"Your high-value wire transfer encountered a technical error at the bank and was not completed. Please check your transaction ID [ID] or contact support for immediate next steps.\"\n**Option 2 (Calm & Reassuring):** \"We are sorry, but your wire transfer failed due to an external banking error. We are actively tracking this; please review the status using transaction ID [ID].\"\n**Option 3 (Action-Oriented):** \"A technical issue prevented your high-value transfer from processing. To resolve this promptly, please try again or connect with our dedicated support team.\"",
